<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Swift Energy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Swift Energy.</headline>
<text>
<p>Jefferies and Co Inc analyst C. Van Levy said he upgraded oil and gas producer Swift Energy Co to accumulate from hold. No further information was given.</p>
</text>
